(text "USB-C 5 V  →  D1 TVS + F1 PTC + FB2  →  BQ24074 (IN, OVP 10,5 V, ILIM 1,3 A, ITERM 60 mA)  →  VSYS\nCellule Li-ion 1S  →  F2 3 A  →  S-8261 / AO8814 (OV · UV · OC · CC)  →  VBAT  →  BQ24074 (chemin d'alimentation)  →  VSYS\nPiézo  →  D2 TVS + R12/R13  →  LTC3588-1  →  VPZ 3,6 V (2 × 10 F, U12 ALD910025)  →  U6 LM66100  →  VIN_BB\nVSYS  →  U11 LM66100  →  VIN_BB  →  TPS63900 buck-boost (IQ 75 nA)  →  +3V3  →  MCU, LIS2DW12, VDDA (FB1), V_BCKP GNSS (PA9)\n+3V3  →  FB3  →  +3V3_RF  →  VDDPA, VDDRF, front-end RF        +3V3  →  TPS22916C (GNSS_EN)  →  GNSS_3V3  →  FB4  →  GNSS_VCC" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 496.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0e3d0046-3a29-42f8-bcf4-1b87c7e0662a))
